	</h4>

	
		<div class="article-teaser">
			<p>The Board of Trustees of the SBAI announced that Jane Buchan, a current SBAI Trustee and CEO of Martlet Asset Management, will succeed Mario Therrien as Chair of the SBAI, who is stepping down on 31 January 2025 after four years leading the organisation. Jane will assume her new responsibilities on 1 February 2025.</p>
